### Gradle (per-agent project caches) ###
# Safety net only. Per-agent project caches belong under .local/tmp/ (already ignored);
# this catches the older `--project-cache-dir .gradle-agent-<name>` convention, which
# scattered directories across the repository root and every sample.
# Created by `--project-cache-dir .gradle-agent-<name>`, used when several agents
# build the same tree in parallel. Matches at every level, samples included.
.gradle-agent-*/

### AI Agent ###
CLAUDE.local.md
.claude/*.local.*
.local/
.playwright-mcp/

### Dokka ###
# Generated by `./gradlew generateApiDocs` (root build.gradle.kts), served by the docs
# site's Astro `public/` passthrough. Regenerated every build; not committed. Placed
# here rather than docs/.gitignore because this directory is Gradle's output, not the
# docs site's own source.
/docs/public/api-docs/
